test/fixtures/

# The ported dashboard UI, shipped as it arrived: index.html is compressed
# markup and styles.css is a single 12KB line. Rewriting them is ~1,000 lines
# of noise and no correctness.
#
# NOTE: Prettier and ESLint now split the directory rather than agree to both
# skip it. The two .js files stay unread by Prettier, because reformatting
# ported UI is the rewrite above, but eslint.config.js does parse them - a
# syntax error in app.js or source-health.js would serve a dead dashboard. That
# parse runs with `no-undef` off, which is a parse gate and not a lint of the
# ported UI. index.html and styles.css remain read by neither tool: not
# JavaScript, and not reformatable without rewriting vendored UI.
public/

